  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nuh 307.01 Board Fees. The fees as set by the board under RSA 151-A:4-a, II shall be as set forth in Table 307-1 License Fees below:\n\nTable 307-1 License Fees\n\nType | Fee\n\nApplication Fee | $300.00\n\nReinstatement application | $300.00\n\nBiannual Renewal Fee | $300.00\n\nEmergency Permit | $300.00\n\nTemporary Permit, including application fee | $300.00\n\nVerification of license | $ 20.00\n\nCertificate Replacement | $ 25.00\n\nReplacement of Pocketcard | $ 10.00\n\nSource. #7663, eff 3-19-02; ss by #7903, eff 6-19-03; ss by #8956, eff 7-26-07, EXPIRED: 7-26-15\n\nNew. #12436, eff 12-16-17",
